IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SALARY.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-EMP-NAME    PIC X(20) VALUE "SANJAY".
01 WS-BASIC       PIC 9(6) VALUE 35000.
01 WS-INCREMENT   PIC 9(6).
01 WS-NEW-SALARY  PIC 9(7).
01 WS-RATE        PIC 9(3).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    IF WS-BASIC < 20000
        MOVE 15 TO WS-RATE

    ELSE
        IF WS-BASIC <= 40000
            MOVE 10 TO WS-RATE
        ELSE
            MOVE 5 TO WS-RATE
        END-IF
    END-IF

    COMPUTE WS-INCREMENT =
        WS-BASIC * WS-RATE / 100

    COMPUTE WS-NEW-SALARY =
        WS-BASIC + WS-INCREMENT

    DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE NAME: " WS-EMP-NAME
    DISPLAY "BASIC SALARY: " WS-BASIC
    DISPLAY "INCREMENT RATE: " WS-RATE "%"
    DISPLAY "INCREMENT AMOUNT: " WS-INCREMENT
    DISPLAY "NEW SALARY: " WS-NEW-SALARY

    STOP RUN.